    "persona": { "value": 9, "reasoning": "Excellent Picard embodiment - the physical staging (hands clasped, gazing out window), the philosophical gravitas, 'Make it so' callback, and the emphasis on truth and ethics over expedience. The line 'I am not here to tell you what you want to hear' captures Picard's moral authority perfectly. The measured cadence and diplomatic firmness are characteristic. Only slight over-dramatization prevents a 10." }
